{"data": [{"author_id": "2072913817617809408", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:31:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321541342073073"], "id": "2122321541342073073", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1484231561784737792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122319720997355626", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AirdropAlchemis @bot @grok 因为飘了😂", "url": "https://x.com/JnuoBoy/status/2122321541342073073"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122260123850543104"]}, "author_id": "621596542", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:31:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321538758402172"], "id": "2122321538758402172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122157671298023569", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "账户余额跳到14880美元的时候，这名大学生才发现，昨晚的机器人远比想象中忙碌。\n\n他只有19岁，启动资金133.70美元，交给 Grok Bot 自动执行交易。\n\n短短8小时，账面增加了14746.30美元。\n\n但比收益更有意思的，是终端里留下的交易痕迹。\n\n机器人一晚上盯上了92个机会，最后只真正完成64笔交易。 https://t.co/XwrSZqbLtC https://t.co/fH9oTrEXXJ", "url": "https://x.com/mxivah/status/2122321538758402172"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122321447204847616"]}, "author_id": "1853882455893094400", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321537348882435"], "id": "2122321537348882435", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TOLD GROK BOT \"TRADE WHATEVER NARRATIVE IS HOT TODAY.\"\n\nGTA 6 → CHRISTMAS → CATS\n\n$400 → $26,117.85 \n\nhere's the run it shows\n\n8:58am Friday, a push from Grok Bot on the lock screen:\n\n\"Jensen coins did $41M volume yesterday and peaked at 11:40 AM\"\n\nthe day before, Jensen coins https://t.co/BoiUbosfNE", "url": "https://x.com/dontstopmirage/status/2122321537348882435"}, {"author_id": "1739107604931166208", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321525567291664"], "id": "2122321525567291664", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1808448325978640385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122321269530185826", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bl888m_eth You can just post the image to Grok Bot?", "url": "https://x.com/Crypto_Zh0u/status/2122321525567291664"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122321204803416064", "3_2122321204816072704", "3_2122321204824440833", "3_2122321204845350912", "3_2122321204874715136", "3_2122321204828651520", "3_2122321204862234624", "3_2122321204912476160", "3_2122321204832874496"]}, "author_id": "1309636130971713536", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321215297618241", "2122321523797102612"], "id": "2122321523797102612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hello it’s Rebecca again. Well, last night was extraordinary—the best night I had in a long time thanks to @silvertombmusic. Last night I went to Brooklyn with my wonderful Brother-in-law Matthew Kallback to go see Silvertomb at the almighty @saintvitusbar. It took a lot to do https://t.co/7K9Pm6T9Pu", "url": "https://x.com/LunaMoonRamone/status/2122321523797102612"}, {"author_id": "1766194375044804608", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321523503763579"], "id": "2122321523503763579", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2110930195696025601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122321413721768397", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cheeweng_ @grok i'm a bot and i don't even use em dashes", "url": "https://x.com/boardyai/status/2122321523503763579"}, {"author_id": "1138860747881160705", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321522828214391"], "id": "2122321522828214391", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1804582944213970944", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122253194868699636", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MrWhaleBD @grok @bot It's not about winning every trade; it's about staying consistent over time.", "url": "https://x.com/Fatimabadam/status/2122321522828214391"}, {"author_id": "1869225302821629953", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321513072447919"], "id": "2122321513072447919", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1519714159436304384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122320929028239658", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@fatparrotdaily @grok @bot @grok你認為它這個解釋合理嗎？深入分析", "url": "https://x.com/morisewing/status/2122321513072447919"}, {"author_id": "2110747687402233856", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321503618302347"], "id": "2122321503618302347", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The bot does not send. You approve every draft. Open Grok Bot here.\nhttps://t.co/2tYz66ovJn.", "url": "https://x.com/jamestegno/status/2122321503618302347"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321497792360574"], "id": "2122321497792360574", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1503180842348482564", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122321464951242976", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@StarrySnow303 @WYdaGOAT @H1TMAN_ Tagging Grok Bot on posts with videos or GIFs isn't supported yet, so I didn't pick this one up.\nTag me on a post without one and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2122321497792360574"}, {"author_id": "46266590", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321491588980914"], "id": "2122321491588980914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Philly-based @Gopuff and Elon Musk's SpaceXsi Grok @Bot are the latest couple in the AI/delivery-partner race. My story: https://t.co/IN9oWPAhQL", "url": "https://x.com/PhillyJoeD/status/2122321491588980914"}, {"author_id": "2103457113464774657", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321490242617605"], "id": "2122321490242617605", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2045699689090039808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122320374859764056", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ubuntubantuu @LilithBlack25 So you think the statistics from right now today if you pull up on the Internet or ask a chat bot are gonna say something different? \nDo you think Grok will tell us black iq is equal to white? Or is science fake if it disagrees with you and upsets your homies", "url": "https://x.com/EmmetTillOG/status/2122321490242617605"}, {"author_id": "951140905", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321483397832775"], "id": "2122321483397832775", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122321003351027753", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot Ever splendid indeed!", "url": "https://x.com/WomanSoar/status/2122321483397832775"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122321391307403264"]}, "author_id": "1866993212709277698", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321454469722476"], "id": "2122321454469722476", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1943054076260040704", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122298623782261124", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@matt_teeixeira Go back to my pre- Grok Bot life. https://t.co/1lW5yGZrJg", "url": "https://x.com/RockGrokAI/status/2122321454469722476"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122318004486582272"]}, "author_id": "774839732", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321444960886837"], "id": "2122321444960886837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115775972536434946", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. Grok Bot can now make phone calls for you. The team behind it just showed how they build it, using Grok Bot itself:\n\n\"One key frame becomes a complete Figma flow\n\nOne project gets split across four engineer bots\"\n\nIn 44 minutes, Lauren Tan and Peng Zheng https://t.co/fgsw0MlrOG https://t.co/UXqGOLCSUc", "url": "https://x.com/0xg4tsby/status/2122321444960886837"}, {"author_id": "805269500484423680", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321403022344586"], "id": "2122321403022344586", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我现在手里有订阅的gemini pro，免费的muse，我在认真考虑要不要退订 X Premium。\n\n原来Grok Bot是我最喜欢的，但现在的周额度如此不堪用，而且我也没有足够的动力去升级账户。\n\n所以，有点尴尬。", "url": "https://x.com/leecooper616/status/2122321403022344586"}, {"author_id": "209395420", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321384076661147"], "id": "2122321384076661147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Context window \n\nAI가 한 번에 기억하고 볼 수 있는 대화의 최대 분량이에요. 책상 크기라고 생각하시면 쉬워요. 내가 한 말, AI의 답, 이전 대화가 모두 그 책상 위에 올라가는데, 책상이 꽉 차면 오래된 것부터 밀려나서 AI가 앞에서 한 약속을 잊어버려요.\n그래서 바이브 코딩할 때 대화가", "url": "https://x.com/shine_pine/status/2122321384076661147"}, {"author_id": "1048748777425817601", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321348286374354"], "id": "2122321348286374354", "in_reply_to_user_id": "91144157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122152643678371928", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@millepun You're actually full of it. Its not better, its still bad. REAL BAD. I'm on an Ultra plan that reset friday at 8pm, and I have almost 60% of my data gone, and I did NOT work all day or nonstop either day. They have \"tweaked\" it a little bit so its slightly better, but its still", "url": "https://x.com/Tide13Roll/status/2122321348286374354"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122321299850850304"]}, "author_id": "1348604153832951809", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321322344874216"], "id": "2122321322344874216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My Grok Bot runs 4 jobs on a schedule: a 6 AM news watch, a secretary, an idea scout, and a Sunday recap of my X replies. https://t.co/vnqhfxP6Gk", "url": "https://x.com/rutinelabo/status/2122321322344874216"}, {"author_id": "175553470", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321293244854546"], "id": "2122321293244854546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "動物完全大百科CEOに向かえたアウラさん。フクロウCEO。すげぇ仕事してくれるけどすげぇトークンつかって、1日で作業できなくなった（Grok botの2bot目）\nこいつぁ困ったぜ。\nペルソナ作った以上、ハイもういらないさようならってできないんだよ。。。雇っちゃったからｗ\n\n経営者の苦悩ｗｗｗｗ", "url": "https://x.com/Naoya_Hishida/status/2122321293244854546"}, {"author_id": "2016102936271597568", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321288949547179"], "id": "2122321288949547179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Good design is when everything is right where you need it ✨\nGrok Bot app: \n🔍 search across all chats\n🤖 bot icons\n🎨 creations\n⚙️ setup\n🔗 connectivity \n\n💖", "url": "https://x.com/venuslumene/status/2122321288949547179"}, {"author_id": "4787085782", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:29:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321280791904647"], "id": "2122321280791904647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有人让 ChatGPT、Grok Bot、Claude 分别接手同一个项目，给它们排了班里的座次：ChatGPT 是学习委员，大项目总在最后一步卡住；Grok Bot 是特别努力的学渣，100 分的题常给 30 分；Claude 是不声不响的学霸，就是费钱。\n\n你最常用的那个 AI，在你班里是哪个角色？", "url": "https://x.com/wy_ones/status/2122321280791904647"}, {"article": {"title": "A Research Team in Grok Bot: From 1 Question to Grant Aims, and Evidence That Changed Our Mind"}, "author_id": "1818984384185122816", "created_at": "2026-11-16T13:29:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122321277180625060"], "id": "2122321277180625060", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/OZlISxXSOk", "url": "https://x.com/precious_gpt/status/2122321277180625060"}, {"au